title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf repo load
catalog: CLI command
target: mf repo load
summary: Load an existing repository, wait for its warmup and print its UUID

!! Reference

```
Load an existing repository, wait for its warmup and print its UUID

Usage: mf repo load [OPTIONS] [ROOT]

Arguments:
  [ROOT]
          

Options:
      --metafolder <METAFOLDER>
          Load from an external .metafolder directory

      --no-wait
          Print the UUID immediately, without waiting for the warmup

      --in-memory
          Read the whole store into memory and lock it there, so that no read waits on the disk (writes still go to it)

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
